    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d189">

                <pb facs="0364" n="294" sameAs="frus:frus1867p2/pg294"/>

                <head>Mr. Seward to Mr.
                        McCook</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 18.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State,</hi>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington,</hi>
                        </placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1867-01-05"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >January</hi> 5, 1867</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> I have had the honor to receive from Mr.
                    Odell, the Hawaiian charge d’affaires to this country, a letter which was
                    addressed to me by Mr. de Varigny, minister for foreign affairs of the Hawaiian
                    kingdom, in which he expresses the appreciation by that government of the
                    courtesies shown by the government of the United States to her Majesty the
                    dowager Queen Emma, on her recent visit to this country. The President
                    authorizes me to assure the Hawaiian government that he has read the
                    communication referred to with much satisfaction, and that it will be his
                    constant desire to preserve the most cordial and friendly relations with the
                    government of Hawaii.</p>
                <p>I am, sir, your obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>WILLIAM H. SEWARD.</signed>
                </closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Edward M. McCook,</hi> Esq., <hi
                            rendition="#italic">&amp;c., &amp;c., &amp;c.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
